BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Master Gardeners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260417T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260417T170000
DTSTAMP:20260416T150147
CREATED:20260320T213806Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T005522Z
UID:41923-1776441600-1776445200@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Presentation: Native Plants: Why You Need Them… & They Need You! Rexdale Library
DESCRIPTION:Native plant gardens have been trending and are now all the rage. Do you know why? Native plants are best adapted to our local environments\, allowing them to thrive in our climatic conditions\, supporting biodiversity by providing food and shelter for birds and pollinators [while enhancing the beauty of our gardens]. You have everything to gain and nothing to lose by adding more native plants to your garden… come and learn how.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/presentation-native-plants-why-you-need-them-they-need-you-rexdale-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Rexdale branch\, 2243 Kipling Ave.\, Etobicoke
END:VEVENT
