LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T012939Z
UID:42062-1776598200-1776601800@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:How to plant a spring container
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Community Environment Day\, Toronto Master Gardeners will be giving a demonstration on planting spring containers.  Growing plants in containers is both a joy and a necessity in an urban landscape. It’s easy to do\, but let us give you some tips on containers\, soil\, watering strategies\, and types of plants for the conditions you have.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/how-to-plant-a-spring-container/
LOCATION:David Crombie Park\, 131 The Esplanade\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
END:VEVENT
