UID:41976-1777314600-1777318200@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:15 Ways to Garden Large in Small Spaces\, Palmerston Library
DESCRIPTION:Everyone with a smaller urban garden will benefit from these fun and practical ideas to expand your garden’s visual impact and intensify your garden’s yield. Includes tips on creating drama\, adding colour\, growing vertical\, the smart use of containers\, and adding multi-season plants to give your small garden greater appeal.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/garden-wise-organic-and-sustainable-methods-15-ways-to-garden-large-in-small-spaces-palmerston-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Palmerston\, 560 Palmerston\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6G 2P7\, Canada
END:VEVENT
